  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello! I own 2 groups on VRC dedicated to my avatar creation work, and I normally ask questions to my members about ideas that I should add onto the avatars I make. And by getting an answer from said memebrs, they must be in my Discord server, in which not everybody is in, or has access to. This is why I think VRChat should make a system where when a group makes an announcement, and the members can answer them via a “Respond?” button! I think groups should have the option to turn these responses on or off, depending on how the owner/those with permissions in said groups want it. I personally think this would be a great add-on to VRC as some people as I said, dont have access to Discord or any other platforms BUT VRChat. Thank you.",
